### =====================================================================
### Prueba Técnica - Sistema de Mantenimiento
### tests/api.http : peticiones de ejemplo para la extensión "REST Client"
### de VS Code (también se pueden copiar a Postman / Insomnia).
###
### 1. Ajusta @api si tu backend no corre en localhost:8080.
### 2. Ejecuta primero los login y copia el token en las variables @sup, @t1, @t2.
### =====================================================================

@api = http://localhost:8080/api
@sup = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_SUPERVISOR
@t1  = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_TECNICO01
@t2  = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_TECNICO02

### ---- Autenticación ---------------------------------------------------

### Login supervisor -> 200 { token, user }
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "supervisor", "password": "Supervisor2026!" }

### Login tecnico01 -> 200
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "tecnico01", "password": "Tecnico2026!" }

### Login tecnico02 -> 200
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "tecnico02", "password": "Tecnico2026!" }

### Usuario inactivo -> 401
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "tecnico04", "password": "Tecnico2026!" }

### Contraseña incorrecta -> 401
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "supervisor", "password": "mala" }

### Body incompleto -> 400
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "supervisor" }

### ---- Protección -------------------------------------------------------

### Sin token -> 401
GET {{api}}/contracts

### Token inválido -> 401
GET {{api}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer token.invalido

### ---- Contratos --------------------------------------------------------

### Supervisor: todos los contratos (4) -> 200
GET {{api}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}

### tecnico01: solo CON-001, CON-002, CON-003 (no CON-004) -> 200
GET {{api}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{t1}}

### tecnico01 en CON-004 -> 403
GET {{api}}/contracts/4
Authorization: Bearer {{t1}}

### Contrato inexistente -> 404
GET {{api}}/contracts/999
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}

### ---- Tickets ----------------------------------------------------------

### Supervisor: los 6 tickets de CON-001 -> 200
GET {{api}}/contracts/1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}

### tecnico01: solo 101 y 104 -> 200
GET {{api}}/contracts/1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{t1}}

### ---- PATCH: reglas (no modifican datos) -------------------------------

### tecnico01 sobre ticket ajeno (102) -> 403
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/102
Authorization: Bearer {{t1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "EN_PROCESO" }

### Ticket FINALIZADO (104) -> 409
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/104
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "EN_PROCESO" }

### Estatus inválido -> 400
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/101
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "INVENTADO" }

### ASIGNADO -> FINALIZADO directo -> 409
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/101
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "FINALIZADO" }

### ---- PATCH: escritura real (modifica el ticket 107) -------------------

### tecnico02 inicia su ticket 107 -> 200
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/107
Authorization: Bearer {{t2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "EN_PROCESO" }

### tecnico02 finaliza su ticket 107 -> 200
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/107
Authorization: Bearer {{t2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "FINALIZADO" }

### Reabrir ticket finalizado -> 409
PATCH {{api}}/tickets/107
Authorization: Bearer {{t2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estatus": "EN_PROCESO" }

### ---- Deseables --------------------------------------------------------

### Dashboard supervisor -> { contratosActivos: 3, ticketsPendientes: 6, ticketsEnProceso: 3 }
GET {{api}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}

### Técnicos activos (solo admin/supervisor) -> 200
GET {{api}}/users?rol=TECNICO
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}

### Asignar ticket 103 a tecnico02 -> 200, pasa a ASIGNADO
POST {{api}}/tickets/103/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{sup}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idUsuario": 4 }
